{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 45, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest to embark\nUpon a journey to Japan's mystic shore\nA land of ancient temples and of modern mark\nWhere honor and tradition do forever roar\n\nAct I Scene I\n\nIn Tokyo's vibrant streets we shall begin\nOur sojourn in a city of neon lights\nWe shall visit the famous Tsukiji fish market's spin\nAnd sample sushi fresh from the ocean's delight\n\nNext we shall stroll through the Imperial Palace's gate\nAnd marvel at the beauty of its gardens fair\nThen to the Meiji Shrine we shall make haste\nTo pay our respects to the gods who dwell there\n\nAct I Scene II\n\nThe next day we shall venture to the Tokyo Tower's height\nTo gaze upon the city's sprawling majesty\nThen to the Asakusa district we shall make our way\nTo behold the ancient Senso-ji Temple's grandeur\n\nIn the evening we shall stroll along the Sumida River's flow\nAnd take in the sights and sounds of the city's vibrant glow\nWe shall dine on tempura and savor the flavors of the night\nAnd toast to our good fortune with a cup of sake's delight\n\nAct II Scene I\n\nFrom Tokyo we shall journey to the ancient city of Kyoto\nA land of temples and gardens of serene beauty\nWe shall visit the famous Fushimi Inari Shrine's thousands of gates\nAnd marvel at the beauty of its vermilion torii's array\n\nNext we shall stroll through the Kiyomizu-dera Temple's grounds\nAnd take in the breathtaking views of the city's sprawling design\nThen to the Gion district we shall make our way\nTo behold the geishas and maikos in their traditional attire\n\nAct II Scene II\n\nThe next day we shall visit the famous Arashiyama Bamboo Grove\nAnd marvel at the beauty of its towering stalks\nThen to the Kinkaku-ji Temple we shall make our way\nTo behold the beauty of its golden pavilion's shimmering rays\n\nIn the evening we shall stroll along the Philosopher's Path\nAnd take in the sights and sounds of the city's serene beauty\nWe shall dine on kaiseki and savor the flavors of the night\nAnd toast to our good fortune with a cup of green tea's delight\n\nAct III Scene I\n\nOur final destination shall be the city of Hiroshima\nA land of peace and tranquility after the war's great strife\nWe shall visit the famous Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park's grounds\nAnd pay our respects to the victims of the atomic bomb's great harm\n\nNext we shall take a ferry to Miyajima Island's shore\nAnd behold the beauty of its famous Itsukushima Shrine\nWhich appears to float on the ocean's waves so high\nA sight most wondrous and of great majesty to the eye\n\nThus our journey comes to an end in Japan's land\nA land of ancient tradition and of modern mark's hand\nWe have seen the beauty of its temples and gardens fair\nAnd experienced the warmth and hospitality of its people's care.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.7897184}, {"token": " embark", "logprob": -1.9346874}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.179594}, {"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.09485699}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.012945068}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.14063488}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.034943275}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.0336326}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.038252205}, {"token": " myst", "logprob": -0.62593687}, {"token": "ic", "logprob": -0.0013931817}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -0.1824837}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0072507807}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.7534998}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.031134913}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0016475449}, {"token": " ancient", "logprob": -1.3917779}, {"token": " temples", "logprob": -1.0841858}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.3618764}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -2.6112316}, {"token": " modern",